<h2 local-id=3D"0fea530e-c857-4aaa-bc1e-17df47db2ab5" id=3D"HowtoUseIGELOS1=
2withUDPocket-ConfiguringtheBootOrder">Configuring the Boot Order</h2>
<p local-id=3D"e54edcda-07c4-4962-ab3e-bdf56206d12c">You can define which o=
perating system is booted by default,<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3=
">&nbsp;i.e. if the user does not make a selection in the boot menu.</span>=
</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"431d2f29-6f4a-4d13-9b42-cdff15ef1a4d">
<li local-id=3D"03d42fff-e222-49f4-9b24-9d7c7978c074">
<p local-id=3D"c35262fc-e681-4635-8a75-2b626ea283f1">In the system tray, cl=
ick on the IGEL OS icon.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper=
 image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluen=
ce-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468"=
 loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"3eb3987704347eb5b8a6ad51da85f56ce5f0b3f71c9e7be02d=
42b04eb81b7c87" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/down=
load/attachments/73302340/image-2024-2-8_17-0-1.png?version=3D1&amp;modific=
ationDate=3D1716364688448&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D=
"160" data-width=3D"293" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-re=
source-id=3D"73308869" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resou=
rce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2024-2-=
8_17-0-1.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-l=
inked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=
=3D"73302340" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" data-media-id=
=3D"06f022f2-bcda-431d-982a-45ccb35efe67" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"255"></span></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"06a73b62-0768-489e-842f-d569ef1784d3"></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"a1745ba6-b010-4a09-b205-98b21b6aeff3">
<li local-id=3D"203a39f1-71a4-4f83-b69b-5aa8c7311e31">
<p local-id=3D"dd577839-f100-446b-b325-ec0f81b9f94b">Choose the desired def=
ault operating system and click&nbsp;<strong>Save</strong>.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"c3a8d3a9-a8b2-49b0-a51f-3bcb10c843ce">
<li local-id=3D"d70ee10b-e559-4f3e-98f8-639d3004386b">
<p local-id=3D"5c917d29-d868-4a08-830b-1010ddda1499"><strong>Windows</stron=
g>: Windows is booted by default, even if a UD Pocket is plugged into the d=
evice.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b702a93-6702-442f-ba8c-6487bd0c939b">
<p local-id=3D"0a186d22-69c9-4fa4-a560-13acee7f7144"><strong>UD Pocket</str=
ong>: IGEL OS is booted from the UD Pocket, provided it is plugged in.</p><=
span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluenc=
e-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-=
content-image-border image-left" width=3D"400" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"f34c=
